@prefix : <http://example.org/orexis/world/dispatcher#> .
@prefix courier: <http://example.org/orexis/courier#> .
@prefix orexis: <http://example.org/orexis#> .

<> a orexis:StateGraph .    # this document is one graph, and this is what it is

#  THE TWO DELIVERIES AS POSED, APART: each van at the foot of its own column, its parcel one
#  cell up it, owed at the top. Five steps each — a drive, the pick, two drives, the drop — and
#  the two chains share no cell. The only file here the runtime never reloads: from the first
#  boot on, where the vans and the parcels stand is the agent's belief, rewritten by its own
#  actions.

:van_a courier:at :c0_0 .
:parcel_a courier:at :c0_1 .

:van_b courier:at :c3_0 .
:parcel_b courier:at :c3_1 .
